    "strategy": {
      "description": "Muse RYO Demo uses local Muse-Glimmer-30B for market/news practice research. It interprets RYO token analysis and seven-day sentiment alongside free Decrypt RSS. Separately signed Coinbase ETH/USD books provide practice quote/depth observations, with delayed fills, fees and bounded risk. Missing or stale required evidence, RYO avoid verdicts and excessive cross-source price differences block new practice entries. HOLD is valid. No X collection, leverage or guaranteed returns. Funded WETH/test-USDC execution on Sepolia is separate and requires fresh valuation, executable liquidity and expiring permission. Proposed funded caps: 0.01 test-USDC per trade, 0.05 test-USDC maximum position, 50 bps slippage. Enrollment records signed declarations and local observations, not hardware attestation or proof of performance.",
      "codeDigest": "sha256:cf53b7cf8d714fe82f24a53c32f2aa9ad0684a3ba3cd6e224163f8897640a772",
      "pair": "WETH / USDC"
    },
